Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.91,0:00:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.19,0:00:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-G
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.93,0:00:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-GIN-GIN-GIN-GIN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.13,0:00:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-GO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Emer projected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.69,0:00:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,to the images of the\Nold unknown - Thoseorm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.60,0:00:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Universe, special-leggedekers\Nto the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.51,0:00:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,stars of the society\Nand of yet another life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.83,0:01:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.45,0:01:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean to tell me\Nthat rich punk Kaiba is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.41,0:01:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,throwing his own exclusive\NDuel Monsters tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.01,0:01:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.92,0:01:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And the whole thing kicks\Noff in less than a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.33,0:01:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Moneybags\Ndidn't send an invite to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.53,0:01:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the runner-up at Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.89,0:01:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the respect?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.33,0:01:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a newsflash for you, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba doesn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.55,0:01:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give him something not to like.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.19,0:01:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, this is exactly\Nhow he wants you to react.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.79,0:01:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a good point there, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.03,0:01:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I don't need to enter\NKaiba's snooty competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.13,0:01:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you, Yug?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.59,0:01:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to enter the tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.11,0:01:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.31,0:01:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I just found out that\Nentering Kaiba's Battle City
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Tournament is the only way\NI can achieve my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.85,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.87,0:01:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.15,0:01:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.81,0:01:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I got nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.01,0:01:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of evil force is\Ncoming back from the past
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.39,0:01:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm destined to join this\Ntournament and defeat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.83,0:01:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's my destiny to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.97,0:02:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I got just a card!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.15,0:02:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking red-eyes, black dragon, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.51,0:02:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So what you're saying is\Nyou've changed your mind again,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.95,0:02:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and now you are gonna\Nenter Kaiba's tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.97,0:02:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm saying, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.79,0:02:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi inspired me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.27,0:02:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And with this baby in my\Ndeck, I got it made! Mwah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.37,0:02:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, my little red-eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.47,0:02:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna help me kick\Nsome major Kaiba butt?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.35,0:02:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.37,0:02:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You never saw a guy kiss a card?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.81,0:02:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,With my red eyes, I'll put Kaiba to shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.01,0:02:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you learn your lesson\Nthe last time you dueled Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.41,0:02:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya's right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Your red eyes is a powerful card, but it\Ndoesn't guarantee that you'll beat Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.93,0:02:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.31,0:02:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need to have a little patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,First, you should get used to his new,\Nmore advanced version of the dual disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.37,0:02:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The old ones were too advanced for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.57,0:02:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They cost me to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.41,0:02:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.15,0:02:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.15,0:02:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My new dual disc system has\Nproven to be quite effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.59,0:03:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're moping like the frightened\Ndog I've turned you into.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.91,0:03:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a much better duelist\Nnow than you were then, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.11,0:03:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But before you jump right\Ninto another duel with Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.89,0:03:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,you should practice\Nwith the new dual disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.07,0:03:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.51,0:03:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta try and sign up for this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.59,0:03:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey Looks like the registration office\Nis over there Battle City Tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,here I come Excuse us You think they'll\Nlet Joey sign up for the tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.01,0:03:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I gotta say That boy\Nsure is determined You said it, Taya
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks for taking Yami To the Egyptian\Nexhibit yesterday I knew spending the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.83,0:03:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,day with you would help I still can't\Nbelieve he was an ancient Egyptian pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.07,0:03:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, and he saved the entire world, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.61,0:03:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi doesn't seem worried at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.75,0:03:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But if what Ishizu told us about the past\Nis true, there's so much danger ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.33,0:03:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.85,0:04:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You know Kaiba's new\Nrule that the winner of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.21,0:04:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,each duel gets to take\Nthe loser's rarest card?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.97,0:04:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,On one hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.99,0:04:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,it's an awesome idea because the winner of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.75,0:04:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the whole tournament\Ngets the ultimate prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.09,0:04:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A super deck made up of the\Nrarest cards and duel monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.71,0:04:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But on the other hand, I\Nput my heart in this deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.57,0:04:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose any of\Nmy cards to another duelist,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.93,0:04:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,especially my Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.71,0:04:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But the fate of the whole\Nworld depends on Yami and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.63,0:04:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'll play by whatever rules I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.69,0:04:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I think we sign up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.55,0:04:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to play dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.91,0:04:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Play dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.82,0:04:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.49,0:04:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this tournament's\Ngoing to be really risky,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.79,0:04:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but we'll all get through it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.81,0:04:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.29,0:04:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,May I be of some assistance? Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.79,0:04:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to register for the Battle\NCity Tournament and get our dual discs?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.87,0:04:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, my young friends, you\Nhave entered into the correct place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.41,0:04:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fortunate since I have\Nthree dual discs left on my shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.91,0:04:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I have to make sure\Nyou're qualified to register.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.15,0:04:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.45,0:05:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.65,0:05:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got five stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.13,0:05:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the highest rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.63,0:05:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Where does this information come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.69,0:05:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Corp performed\Nextensive research on duelists
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,around the world and compiled\Nthe results into a database.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.03,0:05:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This shows your skill level and the\Nrarest card you've ever played in a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.11,0:05:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,To ensure that only the\Nbest duelists enter, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba has gone to great lengths to learn\Neverything about you and your decks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.23,0:05:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.51,0:05:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.63,0:05:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing every card in our decks\Ngives an unfair advantage to Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.15,0:05:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, as promised, since you\Nqualified to enter, you get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.93,0:05:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Chima Corp's new and\Nimproved dual-disc system.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.49,0:05:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to register also.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.37,0:05:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Wheel is the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.35,0:05:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see, Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.69,0:05:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I'm sorry, you've only got one star.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.23,0:05:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ranking is much too low to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.59,0:05:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.19,0:05:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Chima fixed those results.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.03,0:05:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I came in second at Dula's Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.05,0:06:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey, just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.39,0:06:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit having a cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.23,0:06:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It is weird that he doesn't qualify.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.47,0:06:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna burst a blood vessel. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.11,0:06:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He holds the rare red-eyes black dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.51,0:06:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My master will surely be interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.91,0:06:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.59,0:06:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.57,0:06:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.45,0:06:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So you want to duel, Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.25,0:06:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears my hard drive was malfunctioning\Nand you actually have four stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.35,0:06:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, you qualify.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.23,0:06:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.33,0:06:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see those beautiful stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.11,0:06:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, my kisser ain't\Nlooking too bad either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.79,0:06:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew the computer was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.77,0:06:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I was able to stay relaxed\Nand keep my cool while he fixed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.47,0:06:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of luck. Come to Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.35,0:06:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle City Tournament, here we come!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.57,0:06:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.87,0:06:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to keep your cool, Joey. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,send over the rare hunters the\Nboy with the red eyes just left
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.75,0:07:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,guys i gotta get going my sister serenity's\Noperations tomorrow and i told her
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,i'd stay at the hospital tonight all\Nright wish serenity luck for me joey i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.53,0:07:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,sure everything's gonna be fine thanks\Na lot yug later guys bye joey good luck
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.47,0:07:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,i hope he's all right going to that\Nhospital is not an easy thing for him to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.45,0:07:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's mother's gonna be at\Nthat hospital, too, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.23,0:07:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,She was the one who separated Joey\Nand Serenity when they were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't spoken to his mother since.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.31,0:07:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.22,0:07:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But that means that Joey hasn't seen or\Nspoken to his mother in almost seven years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.95,0:07:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I'll make sure that the\NWheeler family unites once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you getting just a little\Ncarried away there, Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.65,0:07:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if he's trying to be a hero to\Nimpress Joey's sister, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better hustle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised Serenity I'd be at\Nthe hospital in a few minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.37,0:08:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've never let her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.31,0:08:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.75,0:08:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the big idea? Out\Nof my way. I'm in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.33,0:08:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be going anywhere for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.09,0:08:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you freaks want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.95,0:08:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a feisty little one,\Naren't you, Joey Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.85,0:08:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you've never met a rare hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.55,0:08:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We stalk our prey and take what we desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.39,0:08:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,In this case, you're\NRed-Eyes Black Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.95,0:08:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, prepare to duel for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.03,0:08:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know about my Red-Eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.01,0:08:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, just step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.35,0:08:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd like to leave here in one piece,\NI'd suggest you do as we say and duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not giving me a choice, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.83,0:08:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I guess I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.65,0:08:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let the hunt continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.27,0:08:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, we'll duel by the battle city rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.99,0:09:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, when we win, we'll\Nget your red-eyes black dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.51,0:09:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd suggest you prepare\Nyourself for the hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.07,0:09:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.81,0:09:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I got somewhere I gotta be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.77,0:09:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.55,0:09:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, what's the matter, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.05,0:09:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I'm just really terrified\Nabout getting this eye operation, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know once Joey gets to the\Nhospital, I'll feel so much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.49,0:09:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He should be on his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.17,0:09:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Joseph's coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.77,0:09:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get this party started by playing\Nmy Panther Warrior in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.47,0:09:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Predator's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.35,0:09:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.11,0:09:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not much of a predator so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.47,0:10:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,These little fur balls\Nmay not look like much,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.07,0:10:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but they're just what I need right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.25,0:10:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Scapegoat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.75,0:10:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Panther warrior can't attack\Nunless I make a sacrifice first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.37,0:10:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So buh-bye, scapegoat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.79,0:10:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, panther attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.91,0:10:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like my panther warrior's\Nthe real hunter in this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.07,0:10:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.25,0:10:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The graceful charity card allows\Nme to draw three new cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.79,0:10:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.57,0:10:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My deck is filled with surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.55,0:10:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon I'll be adding your\Nred eyes to my collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.85,0:10:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.13,0:10:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.45,0:10:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's always been there for me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.51,0:10:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope he's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.43,0:11:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There's someone out\Nthere who needs my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.73,0:11:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm gonna end this\Nduel once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.23,0:11:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I play alligator sword and attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.39,0:11:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna sacrifice another scapegoat\Nso Panther Warrior can attack again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.15,0:11:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you guys want to play\Nby battle city rules, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.31,0:11:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I just heard that when you\Nhave no monsters on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.29,0:11:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can attack your life points directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.31,0:11:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Alligator's sword, attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.59,0:11:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Direct attack on the hooded freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.07,0:11:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.63,0:11:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.91,0:11:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I play graceful charity again. Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.51,0:11:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, a good hunter must acquire strong\Nhounds to replace the weak ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.61,0:11:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So I discard two old cards and\Nplace this one in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.47,0:12:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.07,0:12:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm falling asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.59,0:12:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times are you going to keep\Nthrowing the same lousy cards down?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.97,0:12:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You duel as badly as you dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.61,0:12:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to end this pathetic duel so\NI can get back to what I was doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.69,0:12:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to wipe the\Nstreet with this bum.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.99,0:12:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,When Yugi was telling me about\Nthe battle city rules today,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,he said something about\Nhaving to sacrifice weaker
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.15,0:12:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters so you can\Nsummon stronger monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.09,0:12:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I can offer up those two\Nguys to bring out my secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.01,0:12:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, for your worst nightmare,\Nthe moment I've been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.71,0:12:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Red-Eyes Black Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.47,0:12:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So you wanted to see my red eyes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.61,0:12:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you got your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.33,0:12:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.25,0:13:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.93,0:13:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Red eyes, black dragon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this was my easiest duel ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.77,0:13:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,While you were busy picking cards and\Nplaying defense, I was blasting you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish boy, I've been\Nleading you through this hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.51,0:13:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Waiting for the right moment to pounce.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.19,0:13:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you got your cape on, toothpaste.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.05,0:13:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been creaming you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.35,0:13:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to finish you off. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.41,0:13:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's time for me to\Nunleash the ultimate beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.07,0:13:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Exodia, the Forbidden One.\NNo way. It's all over. Not Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.15,0:13:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No! How can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.31,0:13:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia! Obliterate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.41,0:14:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Exodia's the rarest card I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.41,0:14:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you get it in your deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It is true that the\Nindividual pieces of Exodia
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,the Forbidden One, are\Nextremely rare cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.31,0:14:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But rare hunters thrive on relieving\Nduelists of their rarest cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.91,0:14:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I've assembled three complete\Nsets of Exodia in one single deck of cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.41,0:14:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You won them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.65,0:14:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say we acquire them\Nby whatever means necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.43,0:14:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we'll take our prize, you\Nred eyes. Hey, I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.37,0:14:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We prefer to take it by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.33,0:14:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, "I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.09,0:14:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the thrill of the hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.43,0:14:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, and now your precious Red-Eyes Black\NDragon is mine. My Red-Eyes Black Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.91,0:14:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.89,0:15:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,open the door right now Please let me in,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.89,0:15:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, please I won't, I'm not going\Nto have the operation until Joey gets here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.11,0:15:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Mrs. Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.61,0:15:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,what's that joey never showed up at the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,hospital last night don't\Nworry mrs wheeler we'll
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.45,0:15:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,figure this out yuki oh
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.39,0:15:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,hey teia any sign of joey
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.83,0:15:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing this isn't like\Nhim i'm really worried
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.77,0:15:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,well anything i didn't\Nsee him anywhere and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.29,0:15:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,i checked all of his\Nusual spots there must be
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.37,0:15:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,some place i'm not\Nthinking of why don't you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.41,0:15:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,check downtown on your\Nbike not a bad idea at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.21,0:15:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.12,0:15:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We should split up and check\Nevery corner of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.83,0:15:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It just isn't like Joey to\Nmiss his sister's operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.83,0:15:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Something must have happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.69,0:15:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he'd never let Serenity down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.87,0:15:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He was supposed to have\Ngotten to the hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,to see Serenity at about\Nnine o 'clock last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.69,0:15:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,so whatever held him up from doing that\Nmust have happened right after we left time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.59,0:15:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.01,0:16:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you guys should check up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.21,0:16:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.45,0:16:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.36,0:16:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.69,0:16:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Wheeler, are you out there, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.63,0:16:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, it's me, Tanya. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.73,0:16:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got to be around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.67,0:16:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We checked everywhere, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.41,0:16:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look who I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.99,0:16:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's got Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.71,0:16:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's all right, and he can\Nstill make it for the operation!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.69,0:16:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, open the door this instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.17,0:16:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I have other patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.53,0:16:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.53,0:16:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.21,0:16:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hang on there, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.37,0:16:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.53,0:16:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take care of this one, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.13,0:16:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, it's me, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.77,0:16:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, sis, I know you're upset, but\Nyou gotta open this door so we can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.95,0:17:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not opening the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.45,0:17:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You said that you would be here last night,\NJoey, and I was so worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.67,0:17:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to help me through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.53,0:17:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.75,0:17:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I let you down, sis, but\Njust let me explain, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I was on my way to the hospital\Nyesterday, just like I promised,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.23,0:17:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,but I ran into some creeps downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,town.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.22,0:17:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All I could think about\Nwas coming to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.81,0:17:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But that gang of punks\Nwouldn't let me leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.39,0:17:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They cornered me and\Nforced me into a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.83,0:17:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they took the best card
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.29,0:17:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,in my whole deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.39,0:17:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.89,0:17:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow I managed to let down\Nthe most important person
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.71,0:17:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,in my life on the day that\Nshe needed me the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.11,0:17:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be the worst big brother\Nin the history of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.95,0:17:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But you gotta believe me, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.01,0:17:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd never do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.29,0:17:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're more than just my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.65,0:17:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.71,0:17:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's nothing in the world\Nthat can break the bond between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.55,0:17:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now open this door and give\Nyour big brother a hug, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.01,0:18:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.35,0:18:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.57,0:18:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.17,0:18:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's, uh, nice to see him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.01,0:18:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice to see you. Thanks, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.31,0:18:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey, Serenity's operation went well?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.21,0:18:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.33,0:18:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,She's in the recovery room now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.27,0:18:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who were those guys last night, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.95,0:18:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean those three butt-ugly\Nchumps who forced me to duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.21,0:18:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All I know is I'm gonna find\Nthem and win back my red-eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.83,0:18:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be there to help you, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you will, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.95,0:18:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'll stop by on my way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.97,0:18:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it! Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.99,0:18:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a feeling whoever took his\Ncard is more dangerous than Joey thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.53,0:18:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That rare hunter, or\Nwhatever he calls himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.27,0:18:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,hasn't seen the last of Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.27,0:18:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle ain't over till I get\Nback my red-eyes black dragon!
